<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 14.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 14.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Nov 14	Nov 13	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  237.540     238.030     237.040    0.21 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  302.840     302.600     303.640   -0.26 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.815     157.925     165.490   -4.64 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.686	46.728	48.410   -3.56 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  395.800     392.920     366.280    8.06 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.700     140.830     147.886   -4.86 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.668	15.687	14.975    4.63 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  212.670     213.490     230.135   -7.59 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.875	 1.876	 1.939   -3.30 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.561	 1.561	 1.575   -0.89 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  187.075     187.525     206.030   -9.20 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
